<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div><font face="arial">Hello {!Contact.FirstName},&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Admission Services recently received an application fee waiver from your school. However, the application fee waiver submitted was incomplete and missing information. Please request a new fee waiver from your high school counselor and make sure all fields are filled out completely. We will then be able to review your application fee waiver.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Let me know if you have any additional questions about the admission process.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Sincerely,</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><div style="font-size: medium; font-family: Times;"><font face="arial"><br class="Apple-interchange-newline"></font><div style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial">{!Case.Opportunity_Owner_s_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial">{!Case.Opportunity_Owner_s_Title__c}</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial">{!Case.Opportunity_Owner_s_Recruiter_Email__c}</font></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="arial">{!Case.Opportunity_Owner_s_Pone__c}</font></div></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
